ate" datetime="2026-08-11T00:00:00.000Z" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>2026-08-11</time> </div> </div> <span class="review-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>↗</span> </a><a href="/cursor-vs-codex/" class="review-card" aria-label="Comparison: Cursor vs Codex: I paid for one and quit the other" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <span class="review-card__rule" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn></span> <img class="review-card__cover" src="/og/cursor-vs-codex.webp" alt="Comparison: Cursor vs Codex: I paid for one and quit the other" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <div class="review-card__content" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <h3 class="review-card__title" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>Cursor vs Codex: I paid for one and quit the other</h3> <p class="review-card__desc" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>Cursor vs Codex from someone who cancelled Cursor after $510.70 and walked away from Codex too. What each actually costs, and which one I&#39;d go back to.</p> <div class="review-card__footer" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <span class="review-card__author" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>Ryan Parker</span> <time class="review-card__date" datetime="2026-08-02T00:00:00.000Z" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>2026-08-02</time> </div> </div> <span class="review-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>↗</span> </a><a href="/cursor-alternatives/" class="review-card" aria-label="Roundup: Cursor alternatives: I left after $510.70, here's where I went" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <span class="review-card__rule" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn></span> <img class="review-card__cover" src="/og/cursor-alternatives.webp" alt="Roundup: Cursor alternatives: I left after $510.70, here's where I went" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <div class="review-card__content" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <h3 class="review-card__title" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>Cursor alternatives: I left after $510.70, here&#39;s where I went</h3> <p class="review-card__desc" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>Cursor alternatives from someone who actually cancelled. Real invoices, what each option does about the metered bill, and which ones I&#39;ve tested.</p> <div class="review-card__footer" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <span class="review-card__author" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>Ryan Parker</span> <time class="review-card__date" datetime="2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>2026-08-04</time> </div> </div> <span class="review-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>↗</span> </a><a href="/github-copilot-alternatives/" class="review-card" aria-label="Roundup: GitHub Copilot alternatives: what you are actually leaving for" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <span class="review-card__rule" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn></span> <img class="review-card__cover" src="/og/github-copilot-alternatives.webp" alt="Roundup: GitHub Copilot alternatives: what you are actually leaving for" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <div class="review-card__content" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <h3 class="review-card__title" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>GitHub Copilot alternatives: what you are actually leaving for</h3> <p class="review-card__desc" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>GitHub Copilot alternatives ranked by a build test, not a feature table. Four took the identical brief Copilot took. Here is what each produced and cost.</p> <div class="review-card__footer" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn> <span class="review-card__author" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>Ryan Parker</span> <time class="review-card__date" datetime="2026-08-15T00:00:00.000Z" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>2026-08-15</time> </div> </div> <span class="review-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-wz2p2ybn>↗</span> </a> </div> </section> </div> </div> </section> <!-- Post footer ─────────────────────────────────── --> <section class="post-footer" data-pagefind-ignore data-astro-cid-m66uj5id> <div class="post-footer__inner" data-astro-cid-m66uj5id>  <aside class="affiliate-disclosure" aria-label="Affiliate disclosure" data-astro-cid-ix6cl37t> <span class="affiliate-disclosure__tag" data-astro-cid-ix6cl37t> <span class="affiliate-disclosure__dot" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-ix6cl37t></span>
Affiliate disclosure
</span> <p class="affiliate-disclosure__copy" data-astro-cid-ix6cl37t>
Some links on this page are affiliate links: if you sign up through one, the
    partner pays us a commission at no extra cost to you. This funds the
    publication. It does not buy a good review.
</p> </aside> <aside class="author-bio" aria-label="About Ryan Parker" data-astro-cid-xkziw7dw> <div class="author-bio__head" data-astro-cid-xkziw7dw> <a href="/author/ryan-parker/" class="author-bio__avatar-link" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-astro-cid-xkziw7dw> <img class="author-bio__avatar" src="/authors/ryan-parker.png" alt="Ryan Parker" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-xkziw7dw> </a> <div class="author-bio__head-text" data-astro-cid-xkziw7dw> <span class="author-bio__name" data-astro-cid-xkziw7dw> <a href="/author/ryan-parker/" data-astro-cid-xkziw7dw>Ryan Parker</a> </span> <span class="author-bio__title" data-astro-cid-xkziw7dw>Editor</span> </div> </div> <p class="author-bio__copy" data-astro-cid-xkziw7dw>Ryan runs the make-and-build side of the AI tool landscape for AI Alleyway: the voice and music generators he produces with, the slide tools he builds decks in, and the coding assistants, app builders, and automations he wires his own workflow together with. He has strong opinions about pricing pages that hide their pricing, onboarding flows that want a sales call before they show the product, and demos that fall apart the moment you ship real work. The reviews start with real use — his own accounts, actual projects, the numbers straight off the dashboard — and lean on documentation, user reports, and public benchmarks for anything he hasn&#39;t run himself. No invented test marathons, no made-up scores. When a tool gets recommended here, it earned the spot.</p> </aside> <section id="newsletter" class="email-capture email-capture--card" aria-labelledby="email-capture-headline" data-astro-cid-i26ydgg4> <div class="email-capture__inner" data-astro-cid-i26ydgg4> <h3 id="email-capture-headline" class="email-capture__headline" data-astro-cid-i26ydgg4>Liked this? Get one of these in your inbox every week.</h3> <p class="email-capture__sub" data-astro-cid-i26ydgg4>
